name: Sprott K
family: Flows
desc: One of J. C. Sprott's 19 simplest chaotic flows (case K) — five terms, one or two nonlinearities.
ref: J. C. Sprott, "Some simple chaotic flows", Phys. Rev. E 50 (1994)
tags: flow, sprott, 3d
dt: 0.02
ic: 0.1 0.1 0.1
camera: 25 20 0 1

param a = 1.0 [0.5, 2]
param b = 0.3 [0.1, 0.6]

dx = x*y - z
dy = x - y
dz = a*x + b*z
